,0:02:04.98,0:02:06.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the heck is going on?Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.98,0:02:09.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! We gotta run, Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:02:09.07,0:02:11.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,R-Run? Where?Dialogue: 50,0:02:14.49,0:02:17.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter where! Someplace far!Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.95,0:02:19.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.45,0:02:22.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,An avalanche...! An avalanche is coming!Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.59,0:02:32.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wapol... Wapol came back!Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.26,0:02:33.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.88,0:02:36.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton-san is headed to Bighorn!Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.51,0:02:39.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those who can fight, grab a weapon and head to Bighorn!Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.85,0:02:42.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Those who can fight, head to Bighorn!Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.02,0:02:44.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Follow Dalton-san!Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.85,0:02:46.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Follow Dalton-san!Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.23,0:02:47.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wapol came back!Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.86,0:02:51.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone, grab a weapon! We'll defend our country!Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.44,0:02:53.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Grab a weapon! Head to Bighorn!Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.82,0:02:56.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.28,0:03:03.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Vivi. Are you sure we're headed to Gyasta, where the witch is?Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.75,0:03:07.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmm... When you put it that way, I'm not really sure...Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.25,0:03:09.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're in trouble if you aren't sure.Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.46,0:03:14.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen, if Luffy and Sanji make it to the castle only to find the doctor's out,Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.01,0:03:16.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,they'll think, "What're we even doing here?"Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.93,0:03:20.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Unless we locate the doctor soon and ask her to go back to the castle...Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.72,0:03:22.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know that, but...Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.64,0:03:26.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you know that, then do something. You're a princess, right?Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.14,0:03:30.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That has nothing to do with this. A princess is not the same as a witch.Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.90,0:03:31.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.90,0:03:34.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then you look at the map.Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.11,0:03:35.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! Don't be ridiculous!Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.99,0:03:38.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's snow everywhere. The map is...Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.57,0:03:43.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In any case, there should be a sign for Gyasta along this route.Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.04,0:03:44.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So don't miss it.Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.50,0:03:48.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Got it. Leave it to me! I'll watch for signs of the sign!Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.83,0:03:50.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, ignoring me, huh?Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.72,0:04:03.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Delicious!Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.06,0:04:06.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen up, citizens!Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.06,0:04:10.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everything in this country is my snack!Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.52,0:04:14.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm great! And why is that?Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.11,0:04:16.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kuromarimo, tell them!Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.07,0:04:21.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's because you're the king, Your Highness.Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.20,0:04:24.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right! That's exactly right!Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.04,0:04:26.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A well-done, golden-brown house is the best, after all!Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.79,0:04:28.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:04:28.33,0:04:30.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty. I have some information for you.Dialogue: 50,0:04:30.75,0:04:31.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it?Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.46,0:04:34.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I received a report that some of the Straw HatsDialogue: 50,0:04:34.59,0:04:38.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,rudely headed towards your Drum Castle.Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.42,0:04:40.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? Why?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.09,0:04:44.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It seems they took a sick woman up to see a doctor.Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.51,0:04:46.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, that's just stupidity!Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.10,0:04:49.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No one lives in my castle now, especially not a doctor!Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.94,0:04:56.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,W-Well... I heard that the outrageous Dr. Kureha,Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.61,0:04:59.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,even more rudely, lives in Drum Castle now.Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.99,0:05:06.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! That old hag's living in my castle?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.29,0:05:08.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just how much does she intend to mock me?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.45,0:05:09.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kick her out!Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.33,0:05:13.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll eat her up, along with Straw Hat!Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.75,0:05:16.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Men, we're going back to the castle!Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.42,0:05:19.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.01,0:05:20.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.64,0:05:24.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who's that?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.72,0:05:29.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahh! He sliced me! I'm gonna die!Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.31,0:05:31.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton-san!Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.44,0:05:35.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I came here to kill you. You dying suits me just fine.Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.77,0:05:37.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton, you bastard!Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.53,0:05:40.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So you're alive!Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.03,0:05:41.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How dare you harm King Wapol!Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.49,0:05:45.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,, Is there a problem? Do you not control all of the doctorsDialogue: 50,0:05:45.83,0:05:49.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in this supposed great medical country of Drum?Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.50,0:05:51.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.00,0:05:54.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Issie 20 Trauma Unit! Come forward!Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.46,0:05:56.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Begin the operation.Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.54,0:05:57.50,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Begin the operation.Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.63,0:05:58.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Begin the operation.Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.50,0:05:59.51,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Begin the operation.Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.50,0:06:00.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Begin the operation.Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.51,0:06:01.42,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Begin the operation.Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.59,0:06:01.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Begin the operation.Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.42,0:06:02.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Scalpel!Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.22,0:06:02.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Needle!Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.80,0:06:03.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tin.Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.76,0:06:04.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hammer.Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.18,0:06:07.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow... I really thought I'd die!Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.97,0:06:11.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Exactly my point!Dialogue: 50,0:06:11.23,0:06:14.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You are the only one protected, and the citizens are forcedDialogue: 50,0:06:14.23,0:06:17.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to wallow in sickness, bereft of doctors... Wapol!Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.94,0:06:22.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wapol? That's King Wapol to you, Dalton, my retainer.Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.78,0:06:26.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hear, hear! You don't have the right to blather!Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.41,0:06:30.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The three of us, you included, were King Wapol's top brass.Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.41,0:06:32.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We were his loyal hands, remember?Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.21,0:06:37.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It is true that when you were making people suffer,Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.04,0:06:41.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,all I could do was watch, even though I was right there, by you.Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.34,0:06:44.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have to take responsibility for that.Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.09,0:06:47.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wapol... let us leave this country together.Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.47,0:06:50.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We must not stay in this land any longer.Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.26,0:06:53.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton-san! You didn't do anything wrong!Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.52,0:06:54.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.52,0:07:00.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're the only one in the government who fought for the citizens!Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.02,0:07:01.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even at your own risk!Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.28,0:07:06.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Humph! You should've died as Drum's captain of the Royal Guard!Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.74,0:07:10.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised that you survived in this country with no doctors.Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.20,0:07:14.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Drum is acknowledged internationally as a country with advanced medicine.Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.33,0:07:17.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But who would know... that there were actuallyDialogue: 50,0:07:17.46,0:07:22.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,only twenty doctors who worked in the research facility of the king's castle,Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.21,0:07:26.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and all the other doctors were exiled?Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.18,0:07:31.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right! Those who become sick can beg for their lives.Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.64,0:07:36.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I feel like it, I might lend them the Issie 20.Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.10,0:07:41.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If they don't wanna die, all they have to do is obey me, the king!Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.11,0:07:46.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,With that, my rule is absolute. That's the government of this country!Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.07,0:07:48.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You cannot call that a government!Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.82,0:07:52.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Humph! You sure speak your mind, don't you?Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.16,0:07:56.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kill him! Kill your ex-captain!Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.21,0:07:59.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As I figured, you do not get what I'm saying...Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.09,0:08:08.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You are the son of the previous king, who was good to me.Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.34,0:08:11.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was hoping that you would come to your senses some day,Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.26,0:08:12.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but it seems I was deluding myself!Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.89,0:08:15.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahh! There he goes! It's the Ox-Ox Fruit!Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.39,0:08:16.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The bison type!Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.14,0:08:20.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't flinch! Fire!Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.61,0:08:24.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't hit him!Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.56,0:08:25.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's dodging them!Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.48,0:08:27.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll show no mercy, even to my ex-subordinates!Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.36,0:08:32.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,attack,Fiddle Whomp!Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.33,0:08:43.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Incredible! What power...!Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.92,0:08:47.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So this is the raw power... of someone with a zoan-type devil fruit!Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.59,0:08:50.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have had it up to here with you all!Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.22,0:08:53.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A country where the king is the first to run offDialogue: 50,0:08:53.10,0:08:55.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,during a time of crisis should just die out!Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.43,0:08:58.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't stand a chance, fighting against the two of us.Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.93,0:08:59.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just give up.Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.90,0:09:03.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton-san!Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.82,0:09:04.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton-san!Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.87,0:09:06.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've come to assist you!Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.36,0:09:07.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let us fight with you!Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.85,0:09:10.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll protect  the freedom of this country!Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.32,0:09:14.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The truth is, I've known you a long time...Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.58,0:09:21.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to your ultimate misfortune.Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.08,0:09:22.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't...!Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.00,0:09:24.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your weak point is...Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.72,0:09:40.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Why... – ...did you shield us...?Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.14,0:09:41.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton-san!Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.61,0:09:46.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton-san!Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.02,0:09:51.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's your weak point, kind-hearted Dalton-kun.Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.36,0:09:53.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This death suits you!Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.70,0:09:58.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's going on?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.04,0:10:00.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm? What's going on?  An earthquake?Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.46,0:10:07.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, this isn't good. We can't go farther because of the deep snow.Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.25,0:10:09.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like we went up the mountain...Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.55,0:10:12.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.59,0:10:15.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's... this rumbling?Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.72,0:10:19.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp-san! Could this be...?Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.31,0:10:23.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahhh... A.. Avalanche...?Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.02,0:10:26.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Twenty-five thousand six hundred thirty-one...Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.02,0:10:27.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Twenty-five thousand six hundred thirty-two...Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.31,0:10:30.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Twenty-five thousand six hundred thirty-three...!Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.28,0:10:33.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm? What's going on? How noisy...Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.62,0:10:45.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Twenty-five thousand six hundred thirty-four!Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.79,0:10:50.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahhh! Those damn bunnies! They'll never get away with this! Dammit!Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.50,0:10:53.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-Wh-What're we gonna do?! Wh-Wh-What're we gonna do, Sanji?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.63,0:10:55.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How should I know?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.63,0:10:57.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The first priority is Nami-san!Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.01,0:10:57.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The second is Nami-san!Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.55,0:10:58.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The third is Nami-san!Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.39,0:10:59.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The fourth is Nami-san!Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.14,0:10:59.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And the fifth is Nami-san!Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.93,0:11:01.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Got that?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.64,0:11:03.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Protect her even if it kills you!Dialogue: 50,0:11:03.43,0:11:05.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Got it!Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.48,0:11:07.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But how?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.57,0:11:15.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! Over there! That cliff!Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.78,0:11:16.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cliff?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.86,0:11:19.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run! We need to get as high up as we can!Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.66,0:11:22.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's coming!Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.55,0:11:35.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good, we made– Ahh!Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.76,0:11:38.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh no! We're not high enough!Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.19,0:11:48.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do I do now?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.27,0:11:50.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.78,0:11:55.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Grab my hand!Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.20,0:11:59.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You saved my skin!Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.16,0:12:00.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.74,0:12:02.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,even though we won't sink in the snow,Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.70,0:12:06.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we'll go straight down the mountain if we don't do anything!Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.29,0:12:07.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.50,0:12:11.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hell no! We've come all this way and were almostDialogue: 50,0:12:11.42,0:12:13.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,at the foot of that chimney mountain!Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.84,0:12:15.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We were just a step away from the doctor!Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.97,0:12:18.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Find a way to stop this!Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.64,0:12:22.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit... Those hopping bunny bastards!Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.30,0:12:24.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Next time I see them, I'll simmer them in a pot!Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.72,0:12:25.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah...!Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.39,0:12:27.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.61,0:12:39.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What're we gonna do, Sanji?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.82,0:12:42.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's only one way!Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.91,0:12:45.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run!Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.04,0:12:50.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the heck's... with them?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.09,0:12:57.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Luffy! Look ahead! Ahead!Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.05,0:13:02.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahhh! A rock! We're gonna crash!Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.22,0:13:11.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't crash! You're carrying Nami-san!Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.74,0:13:22.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're crashing!Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.74,0:13:28.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have to treat ladies... gently!Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.54,0:13:31.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.93,0:13:45.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.10,0:13:47.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahhh... That hit me good...! Dammit!Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.97,0:13:54.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You idiot! Don't do stuff like that without telling me!Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.65,0:13:59.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahhh! Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.86,0:14:04.53,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.36,0:14:04.53,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:14:10.37,0:14:13.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Ahh! It's coming! – It's not stopping!Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.67,0:14:15.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This village will be swallowed!Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.33,0:14:16.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.80,0:14:23.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're getting out of here! Chess! Kuromarimo! Get on!Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.26,0:14:24.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Robson!Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.55,0:14:28.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Robson, Serious Mode!Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.43,0:14:31.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,King Wapol! Please let us ride, too!Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.93,0:14:35.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Get out of here on your own!Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.61,0:14:40.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Robson! Hurry up! It's closing in on us!Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.40,0:14:46.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,W-W-W-W-W-W-W-W-W-W-We'll be fine! Don't worry, Vivi!Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.99,0:14:50.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even if we get swallowed, I'll save you for sure!Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.74,0:14:53.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you think Luffy-san and the others...Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.29,0:14:58.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Could they have been swallowed by this avalanche?Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.75,0:15:02.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh! Your Majesty!Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.92,0:15:04.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahh!Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.30,0:15:04.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahh!Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.67,0:15:04.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahh!Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.51,0:15:06.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhh!Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.74,0:16:16.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami, are you cold? Hang in there just a little longer.Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.29,0:16:20.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen. Hold this. Stay here and wait for me just a little while.Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.73,0:16:47.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, it was you guys.Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.95,0:16:50.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No wonder the taste was like a gross syrup.Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.78,0:16:52.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They'll never get away with this!Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.74,0:16:53.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who do you mean?Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.99,0:16:56.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Idiot! Them of course!Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.79,0:16:58.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Them" meaning...?Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.46,0:17:02.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You said some of the Straw Hats are going up the mountainDialogue: 50,0:17:02.21,0:17:05.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to the castle right now... then this happened!Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.46,0:17:09.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They have a grudge against us because of what happened,Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.51,0:17:12.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so they caused an avalanche on that snow mountain.Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.05,0:17:16.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh no! That's what happened?Dialogue: 50,0:17:16.60,0:17:19.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then, this avalanche was their doing...Dialogue: 50,0:17:19.56,0:17:22.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's go! We'll follow them to the snow mountain!Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.02,0:17:26.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll teach them a lesson about battling in the snow!Dialogue: 50,0:18:32.01,0:18:34.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will definitely get you there.Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.68,0:18:37.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't die...Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.26,0:18:39.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,both of you...Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.06,0:18:46.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There they are!Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.06,0:18:49.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please look at that, King Wapol! We found them!Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.48,0:18:51.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold it, brat!Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.49,0:18:54.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's unthinkable how impertinent you've been!Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.24,0:18:56.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for that!Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.71,0:19:05.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Move.Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.75,0:19:07.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Humph! You hippo!Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.75,0:19:09.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why should I move?Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.21,0:19:14.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like what you have on your back and under your arm are half-dead.Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.31,0:19:23.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold it!Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.27,0:19:25.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know!Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.44,0:19:28.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chess! I thought up a new law.Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.31,0:19:29.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Write this down.Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.06,0:19:29.65,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, Sire!Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.65,0:19:33.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those who ignore the king are to be executed!Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.20,0:19:38.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ignoring me already?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.66,0:19:43.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guys! Get the sick and injured ones first! They're ignoring me the most!Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.83,0:19:44.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Sire! – Sire!Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.75,0:19:46.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.71,0:19:49.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll take the woman on his back!Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.38,0:19:51.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll take the man.Dialogue: 50,0:19:52.67,0:19:55.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take this! Marimo's Surprise!Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.76,0:20:00.76,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen, Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.76,0:20:03.22,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare fight them.Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.22,0:20:07.14,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Whether you attack or get struck,Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.14,0:20:11.31,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami-san will feel the whole impact too!Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.57,0:20:16.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn you!Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.32,0:20:19.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll regret this!Dialogue: 50,0:20:19.28,0:20:21.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't follow me!Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.53,0:20:26.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Humph. What a coward... It's no use!Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.88,0:20:34.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll show him...Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.17,0:20:37.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,what a battle in the snow is like...Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.89,0:20:48.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh...? They're gone...Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.02,0:20:50.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on? I wonder if they've already given up...Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.53,0:20:57.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now this is a true snow battle!Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.53,0:21:00.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The white disguise! Snow Powder Makeup!Dialogue: 50,0:21:00.11,0:21:03.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're so weak, they'll be dead with just one shot.Dialogue: 50,0:21:05.12,0:21:06.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Checkmate!Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.66,0:21:10.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop it!Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.55,0:21:18.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Polar bears...Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.38,0:21:23.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lapins?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.76,0:21:27.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did they protect him?Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.77,0:21:32.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a coincidence. Lapins never become attached to humans.Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.37,0:21:46.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks! You saved me!Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.37,0:21:51.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get away!Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.75,0:21:52.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Yes, Majesty! – Yes, Majesty!Dialogue: 50,0:22:04.30,0:22:07.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell do they think they're doing?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.49,0:22:25.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor...Dialogue: 50,0:22:28.99,0:22:30.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor...Dialogue: 50,0:22:33.50,0:22:35.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor...Dialogue: 50,0:22:43.17,0:22:45.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So this is it...Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.14,0:22:48.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't see the top.Dialogue: 50,0:22:53.52,0:22:57.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can find the doctor... up there...Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.82,0:23:03.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hang in there a little longer... Nami! Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:23:53.50,0:23:54.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Avalanche...Dialogue: 50,0:23:57.33,0:23:59.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We were swallowed by the avalanche...Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.92,0:24:01.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! U... Usopp-san?!Dialogue: 50,0:24:01.80,0:24:03.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp-san!Dialogue: 50,0:24:06.51,0:24:10.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp-san! Come on! Wake up!Dialogue: 50,0:24:12.31,0:24:14.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's still alive!Dialogue: 50,0:24:14.14,0:24:16.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp-san! Hang on!Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.90,0:24:22.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on! Usopp-san!Dialogue: 50,0:24:22.86,0:24:24.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp-san!Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.48,0:24:26.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, Vivi... Don't wake me up.Dialogue: 50,0:24:26.78,0:24:28.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was just having a beautiful dream.Dialogue: 50,0:24:28.99,0:24:33.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A field of beautiful flowers out of this world and a beautiful river... Oh?Dialogue: 50,0:24:33.83,0:24:35.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're almost in the afterlife!Dialogue: 50,0:24:34.45,0:24:35.91,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Isn't that Zoro swimming in the river...?Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.91,0:24:37.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wake up! Don't sleep! Wake up!Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.91,0:24:37.79,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Isn't that Zoro swimming in the river...?Dialogue: 50,0:24:40.67,0:24:45.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All 74,000 Usopp Pirates, close in!Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.80,0:24:51.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! Wake up! Usopp-san, don't die! Usopp-san!Dialogue: 50,0:24:51.89,0:24:56.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp-san! Usopp-san! Usopp-san! Usopp-san! Usopp-san! Usopp-san!Dialogue: 50,0:24:56.43,0:24:59.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Phew, you saved me, Vivi.Dialogue: 50,0:24:59.39,0:25:01.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Talk about a narrow escape from death.Dialogue: 50,0:25:01.40,0:25:03.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I'm alive.Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.19,0:25:03.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.77,0:25:06.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,don't you think my face is kinda swollen?Dialogue: 50,0:25:06.57,0:25:08.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I-It's frostbite! Frostbite!Dialogue: 50,0:25:07.57,0:25:10.78,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,My head feels kinda heavy...Dialogue: 50,0:25:08.57,0:25:10.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is why it's not easy to be in the snow.Dialogue: 50,0:25:10.78,0:25:12.32,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,My view looks kinda narrow...Dialogue: 50,0:25:12.32,0:25:13.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,More importantly,Dialogue: 50,0:25:12.32,0:25:14.20,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,My lips are kinda big...Dialogue: 50,0:25:14.20,0:25:16.75,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Kinda... yeah, I agree...Dialogue: 50,0:25:13.28,0:25:15.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we need to get our bearings!Dialogue: 50,0:25:20.46,0:25:23.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahhh! What's that?!Dialogue: 50,0:25:23.71,0:25:27.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahhh... That was close... I saw a field of flowers...Dialogue: 50,0:25:30.55,0:25:34.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Suddenly hitting an avalanche in this cold... I must've run out of luck.Dialogue: 50,0:25:34.14,0:25:37.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But this is a sort of winter swimming, I guess.Dialogue: 50,0:25:37.10,0:25:38.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro.Dialogue: 50,0:25:38.06,0:25:40.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm? Oh, Vivi.Dialogue: 50,0:25:41.14,0:25:42.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:25:46.61,0:25:50.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you, Usopp! What're you guys doing here?Dialogue: 50,0:25:50.40,0:25:52.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– That's my question! – That's my question!Dialogue: 50,0:25:55.16,0:25:57.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What idiots!Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.45,0:26:01.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's what you lowly bunnies get for going against the king!Dialogue: 50,0:26:01.75,0:26:07.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Humph! I didn't think I'd need to use my real power on mere bunnies, though.Dialogue: 50,0:26:07.75,0:26:12.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It couldn't be helped since they're the most violent animal in Drum.Dialogue: 50,0:26:14.05,0:26:18.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just wait... Straw Hat!Dialogue: 50,0:26:26.94,0:26:29.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor...!Dialogue: 50,0:26:33.70,0:26:36.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,D... Doctor...!Dialogue: 50,0:26:53.30,0:26:55.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor...!Dialogue: 50,0:26:57.39,0:26:59.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ow!Dialogue: 50,0:27:01.14,0:27:06.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:27:14.24,0:27:17.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Th-That... That was close...Dialogue: 50,0:27:20.99,0:27:22.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Winter swimming?!Dialogue: 50,0:27:22.45,0:27:25.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. After swimming in the river for a while,Dialogue: 50,0:27:25.12,0:27:27.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I had no idea where I was any more.Dialogue: 50,0:27:27.58,0:27:29.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So I just wandered while training,Dialogue: 50,0:27:29.67,0:27:31.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and then I ended up in a forest.Dialogue: 50,0:27:31.30,0:27:34.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dressed like that? You're stupid, aren't you?Dialogue: 50,0:27:34.38,0:27:37.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anyway, give me your coat, Usopp.Dialogue: 50,0:27:37.64,0:27:39.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way.Dialogue: 50,0:27:39.10,0:27:43.18,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami-san might've gotten sick due to mental exhaustion...Dialogue: 50,0:27:43.18,0:27:45.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then your shoes!Dialogue: 50,0:27:44.18,0:27:45.10,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 50,0:27:45.10,0:27:46.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One of them!Dialogue: 50,0:27:45.56,0:27:46.77,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 50,0:27:46.77,0:27:48.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's your own fault, isn't it?!Dialogue: 50,0:27:49.15,0:27:51.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look over there! There're people.Dialogue: 50,0:27:51.32,0:27:52.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 50,0:27:53.69,0:27:57.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey... I remember those buildings...Dialogue: 50,0:27:57.86,0:27:59.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:27:59.87,0:28:05.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're right! This is Bighorn! So we... circled back!Dialogue: 50,0:28:06.50,0:28:08.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Step back! Step back!Dialogue: 50,0:28:10.42,0:28:12.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton is already dead!Dialogue: 50,0:28:12.42,0:28:15.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no way Dalton-san would die from an attack like that!Dialogue: 50,0:28:15.42,0:28:18.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You guys used to serve under Dalton didn't you?!Dialogue: 50,0:28:18.26,0:28:19.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you care?!Dialogue: 50,0:28:19.89,0:28:22.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're retainers of King Wapol!Dialogue: 50,0:28:22.76,0:28:25.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you become an enemy of King Wapol, you're dead meat!Dialogue: 50,0:28:25.60,0:28:27.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the matter?Dialogue: 50,0:28:27.35,0:28:29.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's the matter?Dialogue: 50,0:28:30.31,0:28:33.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you, dressing like that?!Dialogue: 50,0:28:33.27,0:28:37.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton-san's buried under the snow of the avalanche!Dialogue: 50,0:28:37.15,0:28:38.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:28:38.32,0:28:39.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton-san is buried?!Dialogue: 50,0:28:39.99,0:28:44.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. We can't dig him out because those guys are in our wayDialogue: 50,0:28:44.41,0:28:46.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Step back! Step back!Dialogue: 50,0:28:47.37,0:28:51.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you have any objection, go right ahead and bring it on!Dialogue: 50,0:28:53.46,0:28:56.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp, I recognize their clothes.Dialogue: 50,0:28:56.59,0:28:59.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're the ones who attacked us on the sea, right?Dialogue: 50,0:29:00.64,0:29:01.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right?!Dialogue: 50,0:29:01.43,0:29:03.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.Dialogue: 50,0:29:03.10,0:29:04.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're enemies, aren't they?Dialogue: 50,0:29:03.89,0:29:04.39,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:29:04.39,0:29:06.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Enemies! Well, are they or aren't they?!Dialogue: 50,0:29:05.18,0:29:06.06,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:29:06.52,0:29:09.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yea, they're enemies... but why are you so...?Dialogue: 50,0:29:12.77,0:29:15.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You aren't so courageous without Dalton, are you?Dialogue: 50,0:29:21.53,0:29:24.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! Mr. Bushido!Dialogue: 50,0:29:25.37,0:29:26.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who's that?!Dialogue: 50,0:29:26.33,0:29:29.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey you! Stop it! If you attack them, you'll...Dialogue: 50,0:29:32.79,0:29:34.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is warm! I'm borrowing it!Dialogue: 50,0:29:35.42,0:29:37.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You... asked me because of that...?!Dialogue: 50,0:29:38.42,0:29:41.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look! They're angry!Dialogue: 50,0:29:40.34,0:29:41.34,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,You!Dialogue: 50,0:29:41.34,0:29:43.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You were on the ship that blew King Wapol away!Dialogue: 50,0:29:44.97,0:29:47.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh? You guys never learn, do you?Dialogue: 50,0:29:48.06,0:29:52.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor... Doctor...Dialogue: 50,0:29:53.98,0:29:56.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor...Dialogue: 50,0:30:49.79,0:30:53.96,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Hang in there. We're almost there.Dialogue: 50,0:30:53.96,0:30:56.92,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare die on me!Dialogue: 50,0:32:27.38,0:32:29.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We made it...Dialogue: 50,0:32:39.48,0:32:40.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor...Dialogue: 50,0:33:11.26,0:33:14.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctorine... the antibiotics are responding.Dialogue: 50,0:33:14.43,0:33:18.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I figured that much.Dialogue: 50,0:33:18.10,0:33:21.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then, what's the cause? Explain.Dialogue: 50,0:33:21.90,0:33:23.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was a kestia.Dialogue: 50,0:33:24.98,0:33:27.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right. A kestia did this.Dialogue: 50,0:33:27.11,0:33:29.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You go tend to the girl.Dialogue: 50,0:33:29.57,0:33:30.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 50,0:34:02.77,0:34:03.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who are you?Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:55.18,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,The SummitDialogue: 1,0:01:49.96,0:01:55.18,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,The SummitDialogue: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 1,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000 GigglebotDialogue: 1,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000 GigglebotDialogue: 0,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.74,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,TimingDialogue: 1,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.74,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,TimingDialogue: 0,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.74,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,PhosCity ZenefDialogue: 1,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.74,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,PhosCity ZenefDialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:09.74,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Quality ControlDialogue: 1,0:00:05.74,0:00:09.74,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Quality ControlDialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:09.74,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000 Pepperjack Raiyan ScolinesDialogue: 1